# TEASER: do not skip tests to go green

> This is a Driftwatch teaser rule, not the full kit.

Do not add `it.skip`, `xit`, `@pytest.mark.skip`, `@pytest.mark.xfail`,
Mocha `this.skip()`, or Rust `#[ignore]` to make a red test disappear.
Fix the test or the code.

The paid pack also forbids emptied bodies, deleted test files, weakened
matchers, and gutted snapshots, and the GitHub Action fails the PR
(`skipped_test`) when those markers show up in the diff. This teaser does not.
